Add a shared ActivityAutomation component (loads/saves per-account
settings with optimistic toggle + revert on failure) and place it on
the activity pages themselves:
- MilkTeaPage: new '自动化' tab after 我的工作 (cashier/wages/fund)
- ShareRewardActivity: bottom section (share/daily/milestones)
- TravelPassTab: battle-pass claim switch
- SolarTermsTab: solar-term claim switch
